This repository distributes prebuilt ROS 2 packages for two architectures
(amd64, aarch64) and four ROS 2 distributions (foxy, humble, jazzy, lyrical),
located in the following eight directories:

  amd64/foxy/install/      aarch64/foxy/install/
  amd64/humble/install/    aarch64/humble/install/
  amd64/jazzy/install/     aarch64/jazzy/install/
  amd64/lyrical/install/   aarch64/lyrical/install/

Each directory contains the same set of packages:

  mrosbridger, mros_msgs, actionlib, controller_msgs, hand_msgs,
  limx_arm_msgs, std_msgs, std_srvs, teleop_msgs, tron2_manipulation,
  upper_body

The license declared by each package is recorded in its package.xml, found at
<install-dir>/<package>/share/<package>/package.xml.

These packages do not constitute a complete ROS 2 installation. They are
intended to be used on top of an existing ROS 2 installation at
/opt/ros/<distro>, which is distributed separately under its own license terms.
